      "content": "i know i should talk to my doctor but they r super hard to get a hold of and i have appointments booked like a month out. i just cant wait that long if this is an imbalance. my friend said potassium is basically just a mineral and it's fine in moderation. do u think if i just take one small 99mg pill twice a day it wouldnt be a big deal? it's a pretty small dose right?",
